    "ITEM_DISCOUNTCARDUSED_DESCRIPTION": "When purchasing from <style=cIsUtility>multishop</style> terminals, the other terminals <style=cIsUtility>stay open</style>, refunding <style=cIsUtility>$20</style>. One use remaining.",
