    "ITEM_HEALINGPOTIONCONSUMED_PICKUP": "You feel lightweight.",
    "EQUIPMENT_MOLOTOV_DESC": "Throw <style=cIsDamage>6</style> molotov cocktails that <style=cIsDamage>ignite</style> enemies for <style=cIsDamage>250% base damage</style>. Each molotov leaves a burning area for <style=cIsDamage>300% damage per second</style>.",
    "ITEM_GAMMAKNIFESTATBOOST_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealth>Permanently</style> increases your <style=cIsUtility>armor</style> by <style=cIsUtility>5</style> and reduces your <style=cIsDamage>cooldowns</style> by <style=cIsDamage>5%</style> per stack.",
    "ITEM_HEALINGPOTIONCONSUMED_DESC": "Increases attack speed by 15% (+15% per stack), movement speed by 14% (+14% per stack), and reduces cooldowns by 6% (-6% per stack). Regenerates at the start of each stage."
